OL,3,GNEWSAWoman with '70% lung capacity'
OL,4,Aconquers Ironman challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe odds on 23-year-old Meg Stevenson
OL,7,Fcompleting a half-ironman less than two
OL,8,Fyears after starting the NHS running
OL,9,Fprogramme, Couch to 5k, were stacked
OL,10,Fagainst her.
OL,12,FWhen she was aged 8, she had a kidney
OL,13,Fremoved and intensive chemotherapy
OL,14,F"reducing her lung capacity by 70%",
OL,15,Fdue to a kidney cancer diagnosis.
OL,17,FAt 19, her mother, Lucy, died from
OL,18,Fcancer, leaving her in charge of the
OL,19,Ffamily home and caring for her younger
OL,20,Fbrother, Will.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
