OL,3,GNEWSAWoman with '70% lung capacity'
OL,4,Aconquers Ironman challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe added: "It was tricky, especially
OL,7,Fwhen I look back. I think it was harder
OL,8,Fthan I let myself realise. Starting
OL,9,Fthat and learning on my own effectively
OL,10,Fis that was very tricky."
